  "notes": "{試|ため}す is a godan verb meaning to try or test something to see how it works or what happens.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n- Takes を particle for the object\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- 〜を{試|ため}す: to try ~\n- {試|ため}してみる: to try (and see what happens)\n- もう{一度|いちど}{試|ため}す: to try once more\n- {運|うん}を{試|ため}す: to try one's luck\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {新|あたら}しい{方法|ほうほう}を{試|ため}す: to try a new method\n- {味|あじ}を{試|ため}す: to taste/sample\n- {力|ちから}を{試|ため}す: to test one's strength\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {試|ため}し: trial, test (noun)\n- {試験|しけん}: examination\n- {試|ため}し{書|が}き: test writing",
